    "summary": "建立與追蹤採購單，於收貨前試算每品項計費重量與運費分攤，再核對實際入庫。",
    "keywords": [
      "採購",
      "purchase order",
      "進貨",
      "採購單"
    ],
    "path": "/purchasing/orders",
    "module": "purchase",
    "category": "採購庫存",
    "group": "inventory",
    "sections": {
      "steps": [
        "選定供應商與公司，核對採購品項、數量、價格與幣別。",
        "在待收貨採購單開啟「運費與到岸成本」，逐品項填本次總計費重量，輸入每公斤運費、運費幣別與必要匯率，先試算再保存估算。",
        "選擇收貨倉庫並核對品項數量；需序號的商品填齊序號後確認收貨入庫，再查看已保存的成本分攤。"
      ],
      "boundaries": [
        "運費與到岸成本在收貨前可修改；試算或保存估算都不增加庫存，收貨才建立庫存與成本紀錄，收貨後只能查看估算。",
        "採購單、收貨、應付與付款不是同一狀態，不能只憑建立採購單認定已進貨。",
        "異動需要原採購功能權限；指南不提供繞過 API 授權的直接執行。"
      ],
      "related": [
        "vendors",
        "products",
        "accounts-payable",
        "warehouse"
      ]
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "title": "Purchase orders",
        "summary": "Create and track purchase orders, estimate chargeable weight and allocated freight before receipt, then verify actual stock intake.",
        "category": "Purchasing and inventory",
        "keywords": [
          "Purchase orders",
          "purchase"
        ],
        "sections": {
          "steps": [
            "Select the vendor and company, then verify items, quantities, prices and currency.",
            "On a pending order, open Landed cost, enter each line's total chargeable weight, freight per kilogram, currency and any exchange rate; preview and then save the estimate.",
            "Choose the receiving warehouse and verify quantities. Enter serial numbers where required, receive the goods, and review the saved cost allocation."
          ],
          "boundaries": [
            "Landed cost can be changed before receipt. Previewing or saving an estimate does not add stock; receipt records inventory and cost, after which the estimate is read-only.",
            "A purchase order, receipt, payable and payment have separate states; creation alone does not prove receipt.",
            "Changes require the purchasing feature authorization; a guide is not an API permission bypass."
          ],
          "related": [
            "vendors",
            "products",
            "accounts-payable",
            "warehouse"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
