    "id": "reconciliation",
    "title": "對帳中心",
    "summary": "核對訂單、收款、發票、退款與手續費，依差異追溯來源單據。營收、收款、應收與銀行餘額的口徑不同，請以原單據及對帳狀態確認。",
    "keywords": [
      "對帳",
      "差異",
      "收款",
      "發票",
      "退款",
      "手續費"
    ],
    "path": "/reconciliation",
    "module": "accounting",
    "category": "財務會計",
    "group": "finance",
    "sections": {
      "steps": [
        "確認公司與日期範圍，查看各平台及來源的對帳摘要與差異。",
        "由異常明細核對訂單、交易編號、收款、發票與退款；需要銀行資料時回到銀行帳務。"
      ],
      "boundaries": [
        "對帳、清帳與重跑同步是不同動作，可能需要 ADMIN 或 ACCOUNTANT；頁面讀取權限不足時由授權人員處理。",
        "平台付款狀態不是銀行已入帳，超收或相同金額多筆需查證，不能直接刪除。"
      ],
      "related": [
        "banking",
        "receivables",
        "timeout-reconciliation",
        "reports"
      ]
    },
    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "title": "Reconciliation center",
        "summary": "Compare orders, receipts, invoices, refunds and fees, tracing differences to source documents. Revenue, receipts, receivables and bank balances are different measures.",
        "category": "Finance and accounting",
        "keywords": [
          "Reconciliation center",
          "accounting"
        ],
        "sections": {
          "steps": [
            "Confirm company and date range, then inspect summaries and differences by platform and source.",
            "Trace exceptions through orders, transaction references, receipts, invoices and refunds; use Banking for account detail."
          ],
          "boundaries": [
            "Reconciliation, clearing and resync are distinct actions that may require ADMIN or ACCOUNTANT, beyond page access.",
            "Platform payment status is not proof of bank settlement. Investigate overpayments or repeated amounts before altering records."
          ],
          "related": [
            "banking",
            "receivables",
            "timeout-reconciliation",
            "reports"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "permissions": [
      "banking:read",
      "reports:read",
      "accounts:read"
    ],
